  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "可用恐惧、宣传、监控和惩罚塑造公民，也可用舒适与繁荣换取忠诚；压制失衡会演化成叛乱",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Mold your citizens through fear, propaganda, surveillance, punishment or rule as a benevolent leader through comfort and prosperity. While they work for the State, they may grow grateful, afraid, loyal, or quietly rebellious, until dissent becomes revolt.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1067360/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "削弱敌人后可拖回基地，在监狱中选择恐吓、洗脑、处决或转化为公民与政权工具",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Weakened foes can be captured and dragged back to your base. Behind prison doors, resistance can be crushed through fear, indoctrination, execution, or conversion, until an enemy becomes a citizen, a warning to would-be rebels, or another tool of the regime.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1067360/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "跑局核心会改变枪械操控、组合成协同或强化随军部队，甚至把士兵转成替死盾牌",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Weapon Cores reshape how your guns handle. Combination Cores create synergies between different core sets. Others strengthen the troops fighting beside you, or turn them into sacrificial shields for your survival.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1067360/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
